                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f66561c-5dbf-4553-a8a2-0947fae9db1f",
                                "sense_id": "6dabaa8a-81eb-3855-a61a-fbd49f1a4f62",
                                "text": "Dawniej […] liczono w P. do stu szewców, dostarczających obuwia dla ludu wiejskiego a nadto istniał tu przemysł garbarski.",
                                "translation": "In the past […] there were up to a hundred shoemakers in Pruchnik, supplying footwear to the rural population, and there was also a tanning industry here.",
